# Alias-over-vhost bypass, four kv builds, identical shape.
# config per build: root=www/alpha  host_root=beta.test:www/beta  alias=/alias:www/alias
# markers: alpha=ALPHA  beta=BETA  alias=ALIASFILE  alias index=IDX
# Controls prove the roots are distinct and beta is genuinely confined.
=== afdc173f (release/000001) ===
  GET /hello.txt  Host: alpha.test -> 200 ALPHA
  GET /ten.txt    Host: beta.test  -> 404        (confinement holds for ordinary paths)
  GET /hello.txt  Host: beta.test  -> 200 BETA
  GET /alias/hello.txt    Host: beta.test -> 200 ALIASFILE   BYPASS
  GET /alias%2fhello.txt  Host: beta.test -> 200 ALIASFILE   BYPASS encoded
  GET /alias/             Host: beta.test -> 200 IDX
  GET /alias/../hello.txt Host: beta.test -> 403
